# REHU Deployment Guide

## Prerequisites

- Docker 24+ and Docker Compose v2
- eBay Production API credentials (App ID, Cert ID)
- Domain name with DNS configured (for HTTPS)
- 1GB RAM minimum, 10GB disk

## Quick Start (Docker)

```bash
git clone <repo-url> rehu && cd rehu
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your production credentials
docker compose up -d --build